<Placemark>   <name>Aigina Temple of Apollo</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Temple <b>County/Region:</b> Greek Islands <b>Alt Name:</b> Cape Colonna <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b> Condition: <b>2</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>3</b>  Access: <b>4</b>  (5 is best)<br />
